# Cline / Roo Code Rules: Dual-UI Core Standards

[CONSTRAINTS]
- Zero text leakage between languages: isolated `ar` and `en` dictionaries, zero hardcoded UI strings.
- Full RTL and LTR support: dynamic `<html lang="..." dir="...">` toggling, CSS Logical Properties only.
- Dynamic font stacks: Cairo for Arabic, Inter for English, JetBrains Mono for monospace.
- Punctuation compliance: `،` `؛` `؟` and `« »` in Arabic; Western digits `0-9` for technical numbers; `<bdi>` for Latin acronyms.
- Dual theme tokens: CSS custom properties for Dark and Light modes with WCAG AA compliance.
- Tactile controls: accessible Language Toggle and Theme Toggle buttons.
- Anti-FOUC script in head to eliminate visual jumps on page load.
